 36199                           ;	Clock Switch Enable bit
 36200                           ;	CSWEN = ON, Writing to NOSC and NDIV is allowed
 36201                           ;	JTAG Enable bit
 36202                           ;	JTAGEN = OFF, Disable JTAG Boundary Scan mode, JTAG pins revert to user functions
 36203                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor Enable bit
 36204                           ;	FCMEN = ON, Fail-Safe Clock Monitor enabled
 36205                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Primary XTAL Enable bit
 36206                           ;	FCMENP = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMP bit and OSFIF interrupt on Primary XTAL failure
 36207                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Secondary XTAL Enable bit
